          },
          {
            "name": "change"
          }
        ],
        "rows": [
          [
            "changed",
            "pubkit is now pubrules: when the quality audit check (`pubrules audit --check`) finds no report, pubrel names `./pubrules audit prepare` and reads the pubrules pin from the lock; the repository runs on pubrules 0.43.0"
          ],
          [
            "fixed",
            "prepare lists records an unfinished attempt left from the same commit, and their signatures, in .draft-discards, so a release carries only its own"
          ],
          [
            "changed",
            "prepare cuts the release from origin/main in a worktree of its own under .git/pubrel/, linking the checkout's pub store and key, so the checkout is never edited"
          ],
          [
            "added",
            "prepare first claims its release branch on origin with a claim commit of its own, so a second prepare from any clone is refused; withdraw --unfinished clears a killed prepare's worktree, branch and claim"
          ]
        ]
      },
